st Of U.S. Companies - WSJ', 'text': ':CHINESE LEADERS SPLIT OVER RELEASING BLACKLIST OF U.S. COMPANIES'}{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2020-09-21 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dali Wireless Files Second Patent Infringement Lawsuit Against Corning Broadens Scope To Include Optical Network Evolution Products', 'text': 'DALI WIRELESS FILES SECOND PATENT INFRINGEMENT LAWSUIT AGAINST CORNING; BROADENS SCOPE TO INCLUDE OPTICAL NETWORK EVOLUTION (ONE) PRODUCTS.'}{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2020-09-21 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Freeport-Mcmoran Announces Commitment To Copper Mark Responsible Production Framework', 'text': 'FREEPORT-MCMORAN ANNOUNCES COMMITMENT TO COPPER MARK RESPONSIBLE PRODUCTION FRAMEWORK.'}{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2020-09-21 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Illumina To Acquire Grail In $8 Billion Cash And Stock Deal', 'text': "ILLUMINA TO ACQUIRE GRAIL TO LAUNCH NEW ERA OF CANCER DETECTION.ILLUMINA INC - DEAL FOR CASH AND STOCK CONSIDERATION OF $8 BILLION.ILLUMINA INC - GRAIL STOCKHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE FUTURE PAYMENTS REPRESENTING A TIERED SINGLE DIGIT PERCENTAGE OF CERTAIN GRAIL-RELATED REVENUES.ILLUMINA INC - ILLUMINA CURRENTLY HOLDS 14.5% OF GRAIL'S SHARES OUTSTANDING, AND APPROXIMATELY 12% ON A FULLY DILUTED BASIS.ILLUMINA INC - GRAIL STOCKHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $3.5 BILLION IN CASH AND $4.5 BILLION IN SHARES OF ILLUMINA COMMON STOCK.ILLUMINA INC - UPON CLOSING OF TRANSACTION, CURRENT ILLUMINA STOCKHOLDERS ARE EXPECTED TO OWN APPROXIMATELY 93% OF COMBINED COMPANY.ILLUMINA INC - IN CONNECTION WITH TRANSACTION, GRAIL STOCKHOLDERS WILL ALSO RECEIVE CONTINGENT VALUE RIGHTS.ILLUMINA INC - EXPECT TRANSACTION WILL BE ACCRETIVE TO ILLUMINA REVENUE STARTING IN 2021, AND TO MEANINGFULLY ACCELERATE REVENUE GROWTH OVER TIME.ILLUMINA INC - CASH CONSIDERATION TO GRAIL STOCKHOLDERS EXCLUDING ILLUMINA OF ABOUT $3.1 BILLION TO BE FUNDED USING BALANCE SHEET CASH OF BOTH COS.ILLUMINA - CASH CONSIDERATION TO GRAIL STOCKHOLDERS EXCLUDING ILLUMINA TO ALSO BE FUNDED USING $1 BILLION IN